    "body": "VIBE-OPS vs DEVOPS\nThere are two ways to run infrastructure.\n🔴 VIBE-OPS\n* “Works on my machine”\n* Manual deployments\n* Bash scripts everywhere\n* Server snowflakes\n* Downtime firefighting\n* No Infrastructure as Code\n🟢 DEVOPS\n* Infrastructure as Code\n* GitOps-driven deployments\n* Kubernetes orchestration\n* CI/CD automation\n* Monitoring & Observability\n* Reliable, repeatable, and scalable operations\nThe goal of DevOps isn’t just automation—it’s consistency, reliability, and confidence.\nStop fixing servers.\nStart building platforms.\nPlatform Engineering is where modern DevOps becomes a product for developers.\n#DevOps #PlatformEngineering #Kubernetes #GitOps #Terraform #Docker #Jenkins #CloudNative #SRE #CICD #InfrastructureAsCode #Automation #KubeChamp"
