    "body": "DevOps Interview Preparation Roadmap...\nRecently came across this excellent DevOps Interview Cheat Sheet that highlights the skills expected at different career levels.\nJunior Level\nFocus on building strong fundamentals:\nCI/CD concepts\nContainers vs Virtual Machines\nKubernetes basics\nInfrastructure as Code (Terraform)\nLoad Balancers\nScaling concepts\nMonitoring and Logging\nConfigMaps and Secrets\nMid-Level\nLearn to solve real-world challenges:\nDesigning CI/CD pipelines\nKubernetes troubleshooting\nDeployment strategies\nGitOps practices\nDocker optimization\nApplication monitoring\nSecrets management\nBlue-Green and Canary deployments\nSenior Level\nThink about architecture and business impact:\nProduction-grade Kubernetes design\nReliability and Security\nIncident Management\nSLI, SLO, and Error Budgets\nSupply Chain Security\nDisaster Recovery\nCost Optimization\nObservability at scale\nAs a DevOps Engine"
