    "body": "🔹 A Mindset That Connects IT Support and DevOps\n** It's Not About the Tools—It's About the Problem**\nOne thing I have learned from studying IT Support and DevOps is that the best technology professionals do not start by looking at the technology—they start by understanding the problem.\nA user sees an error message. An IT Support analyst sees an opportunity to diagnose and resolve the issue. A DevOps engineer sees an opportunity to improve the system so the same issue is less likely to happen again.\nThe tools may be different—Microsoft 365, Active Directory, Linux, Docker, CI/CD pipelines, or cloud platforms—but the mindset is the same: stay curious, ask questions, identify the root cause, and continuously improve.\nTechnology evolves quickly, but the ability to learn, adapt, and help others solve problems remains one of the most valuable skills in any IT career.\n#ITSupport #DevOps #Probl"
