    "body": "🚀 Just published my first technical blog — and my first DevOps project.\nI built an end-to-end CI/CD pipeline for a Python Flask app using Jenkins, Docker, AWS ECR, and AWS EKS — as someone still actively learning DevOps.\nHere's what the pipeline does automatically on every GitHub push:\n→ Runs automated tests\n→ Builds a Docker image\n→ Pushes it to AWS ECR\n→ Deploys to staging on the develop branch\n→ Waits for manual approval before touching production\n→ Deploys to production on the main branch\nThis project serves as a strong foundation, and I have a clear roadmap for future improvements and additional features.\n📖 Full blog: https://lnkd.in/g6uy_jUt\n💻 GitHub: https://lnkd.in/ggBEfSNx\nIf you're a beginner building your first pipeline, I hope this saves you some of the time I spent figuring it out.\n#DevOps #Jenkins #Kubernetes #AWS #CICD #Docker #EKS #LearningInPublic"
