    "body": "🚛 DevOps is not just about Containers.\nEveryone talks about Docker and Kubernetes...\nBut this image tells the real story.\n🚗 Application Code – What developers build.\n🚐 Containers – Package the application.\n🧪 Tests – Validate every change.\n📦 Artifacts – Version and store releases.\n⚙️ Infrastructure as Code – Build environments consistently.\n🔐 Secrets – Keep credentials secure.\n📊 Monitoring & Logs – Know what's happening in production.\n🔄 CI/CD Pipeline – Automate everything.\nThe truck?\n👉 The DevOps Team, ensuring every component reaches production safely, reliably, and continuously.\nA Kubernetes cluster without CI/CD, monitoring, security, and automation is like having a truck with no engine.\nDevOps isn't a tool. It's an ecosystem.\nWhat's the one component you think teams underestimate the most?\n#DevOps #Kubernetes #Docker #CloudComputing #AWS #PlatformEngineering #SRE #Infrastruc"
