    "body": "Join\n𝐌𝐨𝐬𝐭 𝐩𝐞𝐨𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐝𝐨𝐧’𝐭 𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐠𝐠𝐥𝐞 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐎𝐩𝐬 𝐛𝐞𝐜𝐚𝐮𝐬𝐞 𝐢𝐭’𝐬 𝐡𝐚𝐫𝐝.\nThey struggle because there are too many tools, too many commands, and too much to remember.\nSo I created something I wish I had when I started learning DevOps.\n𝐀 𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐥𝐞 𝐜𝐡𝐞𝐚𝐭 𝐬𝐡𝐞𝐞𝐭 𝐜𝐨𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐟𝐮𝐧𝐝𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐚𝐥𝐬 𝐞𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐲 𝐃𝐞𝐯𝐎𝐩𝐬 𝐞𝐧𝐠𝐢𝐧𝐞𝐞𝐫 𝐬𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐥𝐝 𝐤𝐧𝐨𝐰:\n• Terraform\n• Git\n• Docker\n• Kubernetes\n• AWS & Azure CLI\n• Ansible\n• Monitoring & Logging\nWhether you're preparing for interviews, building projects, or just trying to stop Googling commands every 5 minutes…\nthis one’s for you.\nSave this post for later.\nShare it with someone learning DevOps.\nCredit:- Paras Mayur"
