    "body": "One thing engineering has taught me over the year.\nThe best solution is not always the most complex one.\nAs a engineer, it is easy to get excited about advanced technologies and innovative ideas.\nBut in reality, a good engineering solution is that works consistently, is it practical to build and solves the problem, it is meant to solve.\nWhether it is during product development, testing or project execution, I have found that simplicity wins over complexity.\nThe challenge is not just designing something impressive.\nIt is designing something reliable.\nThat one lesson I continue to appreciate with every project.\n#Engineering #EngineeringDesign #ProductDevelopment #MechanicalEngineering #Electromechanical #ProjectManagement #ProjectLeadership #EngineeringLife #Innovation #Automotive #AgriTech #AutonomousMobility #ElectricMobility #SystemsEngineering #ProductEngineering #Technology #Validatio"
