    "source": "linkedin",
    "applyUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/content/?keywords=Golden%20Rules%20for%20New%20Data%20Analysts",
    "body": "🎯 Golden Rules for New Data Analysts\n📚 Learn the fundamentals first — SQL, Excel, Statistics\n🧠 Think before you click — understand the \"why\"\n🧹 Cleaning > Analyzing — garbage in, garbage out\n📊 Storytelling matters — insights without context are useless\n🤖 AI is your co-pilot, not the pilot\n📂 Document your process — employers value the journey\n😂 TL;DR — The Meme Says It All\n\"Why understand data when ChatGPT can do it for me?\" 🚶‍♂️💨\nMeanwhile, every senior analyst: 😂🧠\nRemember: The analysts who understand the fundamentals will always outshine those who just rely on AI shortcuts. Tools change. Thinking doesn't. 💪\n#DataAnalyst #DataAnalytics #DataScience\n#ChatGPT #AI #ArtificialIntelligence\n#LearnDataAnalytics #DataAnalystLife\n#AnalyticsMemes #DataCommunity\n#Freshers #CareerInData #TechCareers\n#Excel #SQL #PowerBI #Python\n#DataCleaning #DataVisualization\n#BreakingIntoTech #DataDri"
