    "body": "🚀 Data Analyst Roadmap: From Beginner to Job Ready 📊\n✓Data Analytics is not just about learning tools, it’s about understanding data, finding insights, and making better decisions.\nThis roadmap shows the complete journey of becoming a Data Analyst — starting from basics and moving towards advanced skills.\n📌 Learning Path:\n✅ Data Analyst Fundamentals\n✅ Excel (Formulas, Pivot Tables, Data Cleaning)\n✅ SQL (Queries, Joins, CTE, Aggregations)\n✅ Statistics & Probability\n✅ Data Visualization & Storytelling\n✅ Power BI (Dashboards, Data Modeling, DAX)\n✅ Advanced Analytics Skills\n✅ Real-world Projects & Portfolio Building\n🛠️ Important Tools:\nExcel | SQL | Power BI | Python | Tableau | Git\nThe key to success in analytics is:\nConsistency + Practice + Real Projects = Growth 🚀\nCurrently focusing on improving my analytical skills and building a strong foundation in the world of Data. 📈\n#DataAnaly"
